@host = http://localhost:5180

### 200: a city
GET {{host}}/api/cities/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 404, cities_1001, with the id as details
GET {{host}}/api/cities/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/cities
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Odesa" }

### 400, validation_failed, with validationErrors
POST {{host}}/api/cities
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 409, cities_1003
POST {{host}}/api/cities
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kyiv" }

### 409, cities_1002: Lviv is used by two user profiles, listed in details
DELETE {{host}}/api/cities/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 200, no body: Kyiv is used by nobody
DELETE {{host}}/api/cities/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Every error code, with its status and details schema
GET {{host}}/api/error-codes
